<title>USA: DecisionOne sees Q4 shr about $0.37.</title>
<headline>DecisionOne sees Q4 shr about $0.37.</headline>
<dateline>FRAZER, Pa. 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>DecisionOne Holdings Corp said Wednesday that it expects to post fourth quarter revenues of about $213.2 million and net income of about $11.2 million, or about $0.37 per share.</p>
<p>For the full fiscal year, ended June 30, the company said it expects revenues will be about $785.9 million, with net income of about $31.1 million, or about $1.03 per share.</p>
<p>The company could not be reached immediately for further comment.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
